@startuml A4_00_flow_overview_simple
title Runtime Flows – Simplified Overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor Student
participant "Agent Service" as AGENT
participant "RAG API" as RAG
participant "rag_graph" as RGRAPH
participant "Enrollment Service\n(planned)" as ENROLLMENT
database "Postgres" as DB
database "Neo4j" as NEO4J

== Session Setup ==
Student -> AGENT : login / create session
AGENT -> DB : create session
AGENT --> Student : session token

== Chat / tools ==
Student -> AGENT : question
AGENT -> RAG : rag_search (if needed)
RAG --> AGENT : policy context
AGENT -> RGRAPH : prereqs / program (if needed)
RGRAPH -> NEO4J : Cypher
NEO4J --> RGRAPH
RGRAPH --> AGENT : structured graph data
AGENT ..> ENROLLMENT : **planned** degree audit, etc.
ENROLLMENT ..> DB : **planned**
ENROLLMENT ..> NEO4J : **planned**
AGENT --> Student : response

== Document Upload ==
Student -> AGENT : upload document
AGENT -> RAG : process document
RAG -> DB : store vectors
RAG --> AGENT : document ready

note right of Student
**Implemented:** session, RAG search,\nrag_graph tools, doc upload\n**Planned:** enrollment microservice
end note

@enduml

